00:55:59.940 --> 00:56:09.110
<v Ira Glass>Thanks, as always, to our program's co-founder, Mr. Torey Malatia, who is not jealous at all of the fact that the This American Life staff gets to tape interviews all the time.
<v Ira Glass>一如既往地感谢我们节目的联合创始人托雷·马拉蒂亚先生，他一点也不嫉妒《美国生活》的员工总是能录制采访。

00:56:09.110 --> 00:56:12.870
<v Torey Malatia>You know, I do it, too. I tape people, using an alias.
<v Torey Malatia>你知道吗，我也会这样做。我用化名给别人录音。

00:56:12.870 --> 00:56:17.870
<v Ira Glass>I'm Ira Glass. Back next week with more stories of This American Life.
<v Ira Glass>我是艾拉·格拉斯。下周同一时间，欢迎收听《美国生活》的更多精彩故事。
